SUMMARY:Peggy Ratusz at S.A.B.
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nBring a folding chair... \;-)\nSunday Funda
 y with Peggy Ratusz at Southern Appalachian.\nPeggy Ratusz\, Adam Rose\, a
 nd Bob Songster put on a great show !!!\nhttps://www.facebook.com/peggyrat
 uszmusic/\nhttps://www.bookece.com/artists/peggy-ratusz/\nhttps://www.sabr
 ewery.com/\nBlues/Jazz/Swing & Soul chanteuse\, Peggy Ratusz has a crystal
  clear\, swanky\, funky and fun range of nostalgic to modern vocal styling
  that effectively transmits the groove and the lyrical content. She's been
  honing her craft for over thirty five years. And for the past ten\, she's
  either won or placed in the Western North Carolina Readers poll for Best 
 in Blues.
