SUMMARY:Thai Spice for Lunch.
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nWe will meet at ***Thai Spice for a late lu
 nch.***\nAddress: 220 S King St.\, Hendersonville\, NC 28792\n**A limit of
