  need to let them know how many we got !)**\nWe will meet inside\, order a
 nd find our table(s).\nI will **NOT** join tables together. We will share 
 multiple tables.\nI’ll have an HFF sign on the table.\nMenu: https://www
 .thaispicehendersonville.com/menu.pdf\nWebsite(s): https://www.thaispicehe
 ndersonville.com/\n**Hours:**\nTuesday-Friday\nLunch : 11:00 AM - 2:00 PM\
